.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli backup job set\-enabled\-bulk\fR <\fB\-\-enabled\fR> [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIIDS\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable or disable multiple automatic backup jobs together
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-enabled\fR \fI<ENABLED>\fR
